{
  "$comment": [
    "Go route and wire-struct parity with api/openapi/homelab-v1.yaml, checked by scripts/check-openapi-route-parity.mjs (mise run api:surface:check, affected gate openapi-route-parity).",
    "undocumentedRoutes is the frozen baseline of literal /api/... registrations in internal/routes that homelab-v1.yaml does not describe yet. It only shrinks: a new route must be documented in the OpenAPI contract (then mise run api:surface), an entry that becomes documented or unregistered must be removed here. Never add a new route to this list to get past the check.",
    "structs pins the JSON fields of a Go wire struct to the OpenAPI schema it is published as, in both directions. undocumentedFields lists the fields of that struct the schema does not describe yet; it only shrinks the same way."
  ],
  "spec": "api/openapi/homelab-v1.yaml",
  "routeSources": [
    "internal/routes"
  ],
  "structs": [
